NTL Disaster Recovery Prediction — Data Sources & Attribution
=============================================================

This project uses third-party datasets. When publishing figures, maps, tables,
or reports derived from them, retain the attributions below.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. VIIRS DNB Monthly Nighttime Lights
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Source : NOAA/NASA VIIRS Day/Night Band, collection
            NOAA/VIIRS/DNB/MONTHLY_V1/VCMSLCFG via Google Earth Engine
   Usage  : avg_rad and cf_cvg bands for nighttime-light recovery analysis
   Note   : Accessed through Google Earth Engine.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. FAO GAUL 2015 Level-2 Administrative Boundaries
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Source : FAO GAUL 2015, dataset FAO/GAUL/2015/level2 via Google Earth Engine
   Usage  : district boundaries for spatial aggregation and maps
   Note   : Attribute FAO GAUL on maps and reports.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. WorldPop Population
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Source : WorldPop population layers via Google Earth Engine
   Usage  : district-level population and population-density features
   Note   : Check current dataset terms before formal publication.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
4. GHSL Built-up Surface
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Source : Global Human Settlement Layer via Google Earth Engine
   Usage  : built-up surface and built-up ratio features
   Note   : Check current dataset terms before formal publication.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
5. Google Earth Engine
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Terms  : Google Earth Engine Terms of Service
   Usage  : remote sensing data access, aggregation, and Drive export tasks

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Current scope
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The clean core pipeline intentionally excludes OpenStreetMap power-grid features,
Census slum-ratio data, and PLFS/income proxy data. Those sources may be added
later as optional extensions, but they are not required for the current
multi-disaster scalable NTL recovery prediction workflow.

Verify each dataset's current terms before formal publication.
